<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Schick rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Schick rated buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said analyst Amelia McDonald initiated coverage of Schick Technologies Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- set earnings per share estimates of $0.28 for fiscal 1998, $0.81 for fiscal 1999 and $1.42 for fiscal 2000.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 7/8 at 28.</p>
</text>
